# /etc/containerizer/worker.env: the scan worker (docs/scheduled-scans.md). Mode 600.
# Source control tokens are not set here: administrators register a read-only token per organization and
# a write token per output repository under Admin -> Source control (docs/source-control.md).
# Scans push their images to the appliance's own registry (localhost:5000/sandbox), which needs no credentials.
# Git server hosts besides github.com, gitlab.com, dev.azure.com and *.visualstudio.com the worker may use
CONTAINERIZER_WORKER_HOSTS=
# Every host a scan reaches (Git servers, package feeds, registries) must also be on the Firewall page.
